.TH swap(std::copyable_function) 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
swap(std::copyable_function) \- swap(std::copyable_function)

.SH Synopsis
friend void swap( std::copyable_function& lhs, std::copyable_function& rhs   (since C++26)
) noexcept;

Overloads the std::swap algorithm for std::copyable_function. Exchanges the state of lhs
with that of rhs. Effectively calls lhs.swap(rhs).

This function is not visible to ordinary unqualified or qualified lookup, and can only be
found by argument-dependent lookup when std::copyable_function<FunctionType> is an
associated class of the arguments.

.SH Parameters

lhs, rhs - std::copyable_function objects whose states to swap

.SH Return value

\fI(none)\fP

